msgid "Generating wishes as a guest"
msgstr "Générer des souhaits en tant qu'invité"

msgid ""
"When you generate a wish without an account, your recipient's details are "
"used only for that request and are not stored in our database. The wish text"
" is generated from local templates."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you create an account"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We store the account details you provide, plus any birthdays, wishes, "
"favourites or reminders you choose to save. This data is visible only to you"
" and is never shown on public pages."
msgstr ""

msgid "Uploaded images"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
